Gym Membership – Workout Management
We are currently updating our system to include information about workouts for our members. As part of this update, we have introduced the Workout class, which represents a single workout session for a member. Each object of the Workout class has a unique ID, as well as a start time and end time that are represented in the number of minutes spent from the start of the day.

